{"pageid": 1346, "title": "Riqui", "revid": 2791, "categories": ["Characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)", "Humans", "LGBTQIA+", "Tribulation"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Riqui</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/Riqui.png/revision/latest?cb=20250118055317\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Riqui\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/Riqui.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20250118055317\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/Riqui.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20250118055317 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/38/Riqui.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20250118055317 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Riqui\" width=\"270\" height=\"455\" data-image-key=\"Riqui.png\" data-image-name=\"Riqui.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Barkeeper at <span class=\"new\" title=\"The Luck of the Irish (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGhlX0x1Y2tfb2ZfdGhlX0lyaXNoP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">The Luck of the Irish</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fernanda Lopez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmVybmFuZGFfTG9wZXo/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Lopez Family</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li>Unnamed father †</li><li>Unnamed mother</li><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Johnny (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSm9obm55P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Johnny</span> (brother)</li><li>Unnamed uncle</li><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Fernanda Lopez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmVybmFuZGFfTG9wZXo/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Fernanda Lopez</span> † <small>(girlfriend)</small></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi Lopez</a> † <small>(temporary ward)</small></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #21</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #35</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">I made <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">her</a> a promise. If anything happened to <a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi</a>... and I am going to keep that promise. I don't care where she is. I don't care what she's lost. I am going to find her. And I'm going to kill her.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Riqui , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #35</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br />\n<b>Riqui</b> is a young woman who lived in <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tribulation (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVHJpYnVsYXRpb24/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tribulation, New Mexico</span> in 2021 during the <a href=\"/wiki/Duplicitype\" title=\"Duplicitype\">Duplicitype</a> attacks. Having sworn herself to the safety of the family of her late girlfriend, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Fernanda Lopez (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmVybmFuZGFfTG9wZXo/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Fernanda Lopez</span>, Riqui found herself the temporary guardian of her niece, <a href=\"/wiki/Gabi_Lopez\" title=\"Gabi Lopez\">Gabi</a>, when the rest of her family was killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Duplicitype (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfRHVwbGljaXR5cGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Erica Duplicitype</span>. The two of them teamed up with <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> in order to kill it, but interference from the assassin <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a> caused Gabi to die in the process. Riqui swore she would find and kill Erica as revenge for Gabi's death.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Riqui is a middle-aged Indigenous American woman with dark skin, long black hair, and brown eyes.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Issues #<a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_21\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 21\">21</a>–<a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_35\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 35\">35</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"1f3a2378169409d45918cd3c7d160322\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"h